    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="18">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 18</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ordol ⁊ aðas sindon tocweðen freolsdagum ⁊ ymbrendagum ⁊ ab Adventum Domini oð XIIII niht ofer middewintres tid ⁊ fram Septuagesima oð XIIII niht ofer eastron.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And trial by ordeal and [the rendering of] oaths are forbidden during festivals and on Ember days, and from the Advent till a fortnight after Christmas, and from the Septuagesima till a fortnight after Easter.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ordal ⁊ aðas syndan tocweðen freolsdagum ⁊ rihtymbrendagum ⁊ fram Adventum Domini oð octabas Epiphanię ⁊ fram Septuagessimam oð XV niht ofer eastran.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
